  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EBackland development \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Enot exceed the height, massing or scale of dwellings in the immediate context, taking reference from the local character and context assessment (C1.2 and G1.2 as applicable). \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EException:\u003C/strong\u003E Proposals larger than neighbouring buildings will only be acceptable on exceptionally large plots, where this is demonstrably in keeping with the prevailing character of the area.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
